        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "What is the format of the tournament?"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We play a Scramble format to keep the pace fun and inclusive for all skill levels. Team up and bring your best!"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Where is the event being held?"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The Club at Weston Hills, Weston, Florida, located at 2600 Country Club Way, Weston, FL 33332. Complimentary parking is available onsite, and signage will guide you to registration."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Are donations tax-deductible?"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Yes. Victoria Venezuela Foundation is a 501(c)(3) non-profit organization. Tax ID: 88-3282100. Contributions are tax-deductible under Internal Revenue Code Section 501(c)(3)."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Can I donate an item or service for the raffle or auction?"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Yes, and we deeply appreciate your support! Donating an item or service is a powerful way to contribute to our mission while showcasing your brand or talents to a passionate and engaged audience. We welcome a wide range of contributions, including:"
        },
        {
          "type": "li",
          "text": "Gift baskets (gourmet foods, spa items, themed collections)"
        },
        {
          "type": "li",
          "text": "Experiences (golf outings, weekend getaways, dining packages)"
        },
        {
          "type": "li",
          "text": "Professional services (photography sessions, wellness consultations, coaching)"
        },
        {
          "type": "li",
          "text": "Unique items (artwork, memorabilia, handcrafted goods)"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "To donate, email us at charitygolf@victoriavenezuelafoundation.org with a brief description of the item or service, its estimated fair market value, and your contact information and business name (if applicable)."
        }
      ]
